    "script": "Why do wooden barrels bulge in the middle? [[slnc 350]] That curve has a name: [[slnc 150]] the [[emph +]] bilge. [[slnc 350]] Iron hoops squeeze the bent staves tight. [[slnc 250]] And the bulge makes a heavy barrel easy to roll [[slnc 150]] and easy to turn, right on the spot.",
